_note":""},{"record_id":"RHD-S1809-01566","printed_page":351,"pdf_page":61,"column":"right","headword_diplomatic":"Wollen","article_diplomatic":"Wollen, Elá, jela, nachki. Wenn ſie glattweg etwas wollen, ſagen ſie nur: eláne. Wird aber der Gegenſtand des Wollens angedeutet, ſo ſetzen ſie nale hinzu, z. B. ich will gehen, ſiminale, ich will eſſen, coánale. So iſt es auch bey der Verneinung, oder nicht wollen, als: ich will nicht, kene nachki, oder tane ela. Ich will nicht übel thun, tane rieri jola nale, wo das Verneinungswort ke oder ta voran, und nale nachgeſetzt wird.","transcription_status":"complete_ai_assisted","uncertainty_note":"Long grammatical article; Rarámuri forms and segmentation remain provisional."},{"record_id":"RHD-S1809-01567","printed_page":351,"pdf_page":61,"column":"right","headword_diplomatic":"Wunde","article_diplomatic":"Wunde, Tſchaca.","transcription_status":"complete_ai_assisted","uncertainty_note":""},{"record_id":"RHD-S1809-01568","printed_page":351,"pdf_page":61,"column":"right","headword_diplomatic":"Wünſchen","article_diplomatic":"Wünſchen, Ela, nachki. Wollte Gott! Sonúca.","transcription_status":"complete_ai_assisted","uncertainty_note":"Rarámuri forms remain provisional."},{"record_id":"RHD-S1809-01571","printed_page":351,"pdf_page":61,"column":"right","headword_diplomatic":"Wurm","article_diplomatic":"Wurm, Saiki.","transcription_status":"complete_ai_assisted","uncertainty_note":""},{"record_id":"RHD-S1809-01578","printed_page":351,"pdf_page":61,"column":"right","headword_diplomatic":"Zahl","article_diplomatic":"Zahl, Taralíki.","transcription_status":"complete_ai_assisted","uncertainty_note":""},{"record_id":"RHD-S1809-01579","printed_page":351,"pdf_page":61,"column":"right","headword_diplomatic":"Zahlbar","article_diplomatic":"Zahlbar, Tarálati.","transcription_status":"complete_ai_assisted","uncertainty_note":""},{"record_id":"RHD-S1809-01580","printed_page":351,"pdf_page":61,"column":"right","headword_diplomatic":"Zählen","art